    - target: {fileID: 1652559679839956719, guid: 8ae6ad3614f9d284690b7ccab06fdd24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Do not open unopened products.


        An unopened product must have

        no
        damage to the box, no additional tape

        under the blue tape along
        the top seam,

        and the blue tape must be applied only once

        along
        each side of the seam.


        If any of these conditions are not met,

        treat
        it as an opened product.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1713763799164998727, guid: 8ae6ad3614f9d284690b7ccab06fdd24, type: 3}
