    - target: {fileID: 1731081175105600912, guid: 8ae6ad3614f9d284690b7ccab06fdd24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'After 3 consecutive successful inspections, your trust increases by
        1.

        As long as you maintain your streak,

        each additional
        success increases it by 1.


        A failed inspection reduces your trust
        by 5

        and resets your success streak.


        You can check your
        consecutive success

        count by the diamond icons next to your rank.


        If
        your trust reaches 0, you will be discarded.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
