    - target: {fileID: 2987837931180693227, guid: 8ae6ad3614f9d284690b7ccab06fdd24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Begin today\u2019s work as a defect inspection robot.\nRotate the returned
        product with the mouse\nor arrow keys to check its condition.\nYou can adjust
        the sensitivity in the Settings menu [ESC].\n\nFirst, determine whether the
        box has been opened.\nFor opened products, open the box\nand inspect the
        motor inside."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3073585505411991598, guid: 8ae6ad3614f9d284690b7ccab06fdd24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'During work, you can use the features by clicking

        the buttons
        or pressing the corresponding shortcut keys.


        Check the key displayed
        on each button.

        Select the inspection result by clicking a button
        or pressing the corresponding number key.


        You can rotate the product
        being inspected with the mouse

        or arrow keys, and zoom in or out
        using the mouse wheel.


        Use whichever is more comfortable: mouse
        or keyboard.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
