    - target: {fileID: 4974310346822735405, guid: 8ae6ad3614f9d284690b7ccab06fdd24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'When inspecting the motor,

        check its exterior and propeller
        condition.


        [Contamination]

        Check for green contamination
        or black stains on the surface.


        [Propeller Color]

        There
        are four possible propeller colors.

        Refer to the example images
        to identify the color.


        [Inner Propeller]

        Check behind
        the cover on the back of the motor.

        Make sure to inspect inside
        the cover.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5033695768954597868, guid: 8ae6ad3614f9d284690b7ccab06fdd24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
