    - target: {fileID: 5166763506543117150, guid: 8ae6ad3614f9d284690b7ccab06fdd24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Fuel keeps you operational.

        10 fuel is provided at the start
        of each day,

        and 2 fuel is consumed for every product inspected.


        Manage
        your fuel carefully.

        If your fuel reaches 0, you will be discarded.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5258858862928076487, guid: 8ae6ad3614f9d284690b7ccab06fdd24, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "The standard work hours are 09:00\u201315:00\n(3 minutes in real time).\n\nIf
        you have completed all tasks,\nyou can end your shift at any time\nby selecting
        \u2018[P] End Work\u2019,\nregardless of the remaining time.\n\nPurchasing
        upgrades can improve\nyour work hours and performance."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
